WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.040
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright is not

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.160
allowed to violate the SCP Foundation dress
code, nor encourage others to do so, even

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.000
on “Casual Fridays.”

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.080
A note appended to this rule reads, “No
matter how many times you say please, Dr.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.560
Bright, we won't put any of the hats you've
been asking about into the dress code.”

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.960
And the list of hats that&nbsp;
Dr. Bright has facetiously&nbsp;

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.240
requested has been nothing short of impressive,

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:31.120
including a freakishly tall, white “Doug
Dimmadome”-esque cowboy hat, and a novelty

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:34.560
propellor hat with actual, functioning helicopter
propellors.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:39.200
A number of other hats he’s suggested - simple,
non-anomalous baseball caps with humorous

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.680
slogans printed on them - have been deemed
to be HR violations.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:44.640
Sorry, Jack.

